  "That backup is empty.": "Esa copia de seguridad está vacía.",
  "That backup is in format {version}, which this build doesn't know how to read.": "Esa copia de seguridad está en formato {version}, que esta compilación no sabe leer.",
  "That doesn't look like a URL. Paste an addon link, or one starting with https://": "Eso no parece una URL. Pega un enlace de complemento, o uno que empiece por https://",
